WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.642
Nayi job mil gayi?

2
00:00:01.642 --> 00:00:02.463
Badhaai ho!

3
00:00:02.463 --> 00:00:04.029
Lekin ab naya shehar,

4
00:00:04.029 --> 00:00:05.148
rehne ki jagah,

5
00:00:05.148 --> 00:00:05.670
khaana,

6
00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.684
aur office tak ka raasta...

7
00:00:07.684 --> 00:00:09.772
sab kuch khud dhoondhna hai.

8
00:00:10.222 --> 00:00:11.462
Miliye Settlr se.

9
00:00:11.462 --> 00:00:12.119
Nayi job,

10
00:00:12.119 --> 00:00:12.995
naya shehar,

11
00:00:12.995 --> 00:00:14.308
everything sorted.

12
00:00:14.308 --> 00:00:16.059
Aur shuruaat ho rahi hai

13
00:00:16.059 --> 00:00:16.643
Pune se.

14
00:00:17.093 --> 00:00:18.129
Bas kuch sawaal.

15
00:00:18.129 --> 00:00:19.684
Kis shehar ja rahe hain,

16
00:00:19.684 --> 00:00:20.849
office kahaan hai,

17
00:00:20.849 --> 00:00:22.339
kab shift ho rahe hain,

18
00:00:22.339 --> 00:00:24.023
aur mahine ka budget kitna

19
00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:24.282
hai.

20
00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:26.949
Phir Settlr dikhata hai office

21
00:00:26.949 --> 00:00:28.501
ke paas PG aur flats,

22
00:00:28.501 --> 00:00:29.683
tiffin services,

23
00:00:29.683 --> 00:00:31.382
aur commute ke options,

24
00:00:31.382 --> 00:00:33.377
doori aur kharche ke saath.

25
00:00:33.377 --> 00:00:34.411
Filter kijiye,

26
00:00:34.411 --> 00:00:35.297
save kijiye,

27
00:00:35.297 --> 00:00:36.701
aur compare kijiye.

28
00:00:37.151 --> 00:00:39.137
Aapka plan har kharcha alag

29
00:00:39.137 --> 00:00:39.945
rakhta hai:

30
00:00:39.945 --> 00:00:40.534
monthly,

31
00:00:40.534 --> 00:00:41.196
one-time,

32
00:00:41.196 --> 00:00:42.078
aur deposit.

33
00:00:42.078 --> 00:00:44.064
PG mein khaana shaamil hai,

34
00:00:44.064 --> 00:00:46.049
toh tiffin ka paisa dobaara

35
00:00:46.049 --> 00:00:46.858
nahi judta.

36
00:00:47.307 --> 00:00:48.899
Move date ke hisaab se

37
00:00:48.899 --> 00:00:49.623
checklist,

38
00:00:49.623 --> 00:00:52.011
aur dashboard par poori taiyaari,

39
00:00:52.011 --> 00:00:53.024
ek nazar mein.

40
00:00:54.987 --> 00:00:55.530
Settlr.

41
00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:56.228
Nayi job,

42
00:00:56.228 --> 00:00:57.159
naya shehar,

43
00:00:57.159 --> 00:00:58.400
sab kuch sorted.
